# Golden ELF test fixtures (tools/abi/fixtures) are tiny (~300 B) version-controlled
# test data, NOT firmware artifacts — keep them as regular git blobs so any checkout
# (CI without `lfs: true`, a fresh clone) gets the real bytes. The general *.elf LFS
# rule above is for large firmware ELFs, which are gitignored and never committed.
tools/abi/fixtures/*.elf !filter !diff !merge -text
